cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper below."
title: "Probe-set signature instability across five feature selection algorithms"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code and complete numerical results for a comparative benchmark of five feature
  selection algorithms applied to two curated leukemia microarray cohorts, quantifying both
  within-method stability under resampling and between-method agreement.
